{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have all the pieces. Let me verify the hospital renaming date by reading the article, then confirm the 539-day calculation.\n\nScout Demchak born February 29, 2020 at Coney Island Hospital. Hospital renamed to Ruth Bader Ginsburg Hospital on August 6, 2021. Let me verify the date and the 539-day count.\n\nFrom Feb 29, 2020 to Aug 6, 2021:\n- Feb 29 → Dec 31, 2020: 306 days\n- Jan 1 → Aug 6, 2021: 31+28+31+30+31+30+31+6 = 218 days\n- Total: 306 + 218 = 524 days\n\nThat's 524, not 539. Let me read the article to confirm the exact renaming date.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d100\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_9fd47c05c5444ecaaf3a5066","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789482570,"id":"chatcmpl-5d59eae8-7df0-980a-9537-64428e2f0763","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19496,"completion_tokens":192,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":19688,"cached_tokens":15232,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":15232},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}